  ventricular eccentricity index and systolic tissue Doppler velocity of tricuspid annulus correlated highly            
  significant with PVR, TAPSE correlated with PVR and CO. Right ventricular myocardial performance index correlated     
  with CO. CONCLUSION In 10% of invasively proven PH, the diagnosis can be missed by estimation of RVSP by              
