│ Review Title: Doppler trans‐thoracic echocardiography for detection of pulmonary hypertension in adults              │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ Selection Criteria:                                                                                                  │
│ - Include studies evaluating diagnostic accuracy of trans-thoracic Doppler echocardiography for detecting PH         │
│ - Reference standard must be right-heart catheterisation                                                             │
│ - Reference standard threshold must be 25 mmHg                                                                       │
│ - Exclude diagnostic case-control studies (two-gate design)                                                          │
│ - Exclude studies without sufficient TP, FP, TN, FN data                                                             │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ For each study, provide a decision (INCLUDE/EXCLUDE) with brief rationale.                                           │
